      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The inspector has opened the fridge with his own key, and someone is inside, just not the cook everyone was worried about. The man's papers are in order, and the inspector has to apologise. Meanwhile Fedya, who really was hiding, wants to know who got him out.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
